e":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"},{"type":"text","text":", toggling the appearance of countries in a vector tileset as they are tapped."}],"role":"article","title":"Set Feature State (Vector Source)","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestatevectorexample","kind":"article"}}}